.TH paynal-import 1  "import " 
.SH NAME
paynal\-import \- Import requests from external formats (Postman v2.1, Insomnia v4)
.SH SYNOPSIS
\fBpaynal import\fR [\fB\-o\fR|\fB\-\-out\fR] [\fB\-h\fR|\fB\-\-help\fR] <\fIFILE\fR> 
.SH DESCRIPTION
Import requests from external formats (Postman v2.1, Insomnia v4)
.SH OPTIONS
.TP
\fB\-o\fR, \fB\-\-out\fR \fI<OUT>\fR [default: collections]
Output directory for imported YAML collection files
.TP
\fB\-h\fR, \fB\-\-help\fR
Print help
.TP
<\fIFILE\fR>
Path to Postman or Insomnia JSON file
